    <title>Policy &amp; Terms | ConsoleHaven</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/shared.css">
</head>
<body>

    <a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>

    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main id="main-content" class="product-page">

        <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
            <ol>
                <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li aria-current="page">Policy &amp; Terms</li>
            </ol>
        </nav>

        <section class="product-details">

            <h1 class="product-title">Policy &amp; Terms</h1>
            <p class="product-sub">Last updated: August 2026</p>

            <h2 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h2>
            <p>ConsoleHaven collects only the information needed to operate your account and process your orders: your username, email address, delivery address and order history. We do not sell personal data to third parties.</p>
            <p>Passwords are never stored in readable form. All account credentials are protected using secure hashing before being written to our database.</p>

            <h2 class="section-title">Shipping &amp; Delivery</h2>
            <p>Standard delivery takes five to seven business days and is free on orders over $50. Express delivery arrives within two to three business days for $9.99. Store pickup is available within 24 hours of ordering.</p>

            <h2 class="section-title">Returns &amp; Refunds</h2>
            <p>Unopened products may be returned within 30 days of delivery for a full refund. Opened software and digital download codes cannot be returned once redeemed, except where the product is faulty.</p>
            <p>To start a return, contact our support team with your order number. Refunds are processed to the original payment method within five business days of us receiving the returned item.</p>

            <h2 class="section-title">Account Terms</h2>
            <table class="spec-table">
                <caption class="visually-hidden">Summary of account terms</caption>
                <tbody>
                    <tr><th scope="row">Minimum Age</th><td>13 years, or 16 within the EU</td></tr>
                    <tr><th scope="row">Account Sharing</th><td>Not permitted — one account per person</td></tr>
                    <tr><th scope="row">Username Policy</th><td>Must be unique and free of offensive language</td></tr>
                    <tr><th scope="row">Locked Accounts</th><td>Locked users cannot perform any operation on the site</td></tr>
                    <tr><th scope="row">Data Retention</th><td>Deleted accounts are removed permanently within 30 days</td></tr>
                    <tr><th scope="row">Deactivation</th><td>Reversible at any time by logging back in</td></tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>

            <h2 class="section-title">Community Guidelines</h2>
            <p>Forum posts, blog entries and product reviews must remain respectful. We remove content that contains harassment, spam or deliberately misleading claims about products. Repeated breaches result in the account being locked.</p>

            <h2 class="section-title">Image Attribution</h2>
            <p>Product images displayed on this site are the property of their respective publishers and manufacturers. They are reproduced here for non-commercial educational purposes as part of a university assignment. No claim of ownership is made over any trademark, logo or cover artwork shown.</p>

            <h2 class="section-title">Contact</h2>
            <p>For questions about this policy, email ConsoleHaven@rmitvnsgs.com or use the links in the site footer.</p>

        </section>

    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
